Data Notice:

Mineralogical data (optical properties, crystallography, occurrence) are
factual data compiled from published literature and open databases
(Nesse 2013; Deer/Howie/Zussman 2013; RRUFF; Mindat; Klein & Dutrow 2007;
Chang et al. 2006). Facts are not subject to copyright, but attribution is
given in `src/data/references.ts` and on each mineral detail page. Users of
this dataset are encouraged to cite the original sources.

All 3D models are procedurally generated schematic representations
(`procedural_schematic`), not precise crystal face reconstructions, and are
provided for educational illustration only.
